Description: UDP Interactive Connectivity Establishment library (development files)
 libjuice opens bidirectional UDP streams through NAT traversal with ICE
 (RFC 8445), as WebRTC does. It is the ICE backend of libdatachannel.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake package configuration.

